And then this was the city solicitor sent this a little ways back and I send it to the entire council as well, just because we had started getting a lot of emails about leaf blowers.

279
00:28:49,926 --> 00:28:51,766
I wanted to make sure people had this in front of them.

280
00:28:51,926 --> 00:28:57,127
So thank you, Norman, and I'm gonna start screen sharing and just kind of going through this.

