This is more large properties.

298
00:30:29,439 --> 00:30:40,728
And then commercial leaf blower operator is an entity organization that employs two or more employees who receive income remuneration or compensation of any kind, whether as a fee, and that just goes into that.

299
00:30:42,269 --> 00:30:46,812
And this accepts municipal operators and municipal contractors are excluded from this definition.

300
00:30:47,833 --> 00:30:50,535
So the limitations that have been offered in this

301
